WEBVTT

00:01.400 --> 00:04.420
<b>Vermilio and Helck are
to defeat the Human King.</b>

00:04.590 --> 00:06.490
<b>Such is Azudra's plan.</b>

00:07.160 --> 00:10.370
<b>Meanwhile, Asta,
who infiltrated into human lands,</b>

00:10.620 --> 00:14.410
<b>met Sharuami,
who is locked up in the castle.</b>

01:46.010 --> 01:51.000
<b>Phase 2</b>

01:51.680 --> 01:53.430
<b>Now, then, Lady Vermilio.</b>

01:52.050 --> 01:56.780
<b>Power Level 48</b>

01:52.050 --> 01:56.780
<b>Seach Party Leader Sandava</b>

01:54.010 --> 01:56.310
<b>Please be careful on your way.</b>

01:57.020 --> 01:57.770
<b>Yeah.</b>

01:58.190 --> 01:59.350
<b>You too, don't be too rash.</b>

02:00.060 --> 02:02.190
<b>I'm counting on you to report to Azudra.</b>

02:02.690 --> 02:03.360
<b>Yes, ma'am.</b>

02:08.400 --> 02:10.610
<b>Alright, let's also hurry on ahead.</b>

02:10.950 --> 02:11.920
<b>Okay!</b>

02:11.920 --> 02:12.570
<b>Tweet!</b>

02:13.450 --> 02:15.450
<b>Azudra, don't let your guard down.</b>

02:16.080 --> 02:18.460
<b>As they currently are,
humans are quite dangerous.</b>

02:19.960 --> 02:21.880
<b>Right. It should be soon.</b>

02:22.500 --> 02:24.540
<b>Soon, the fight with humans will...</b>

02:25.920 --> 02:27.130
<b>Annie!</b>

02:29.090 --> 02:30.680
<b>Yeah. I'll be right there.</b>

02:31.550 --> 02:32.260
<b>Helck...</b>

02:32.930 --> 02:34.720
<b>I trust you.</b>

02:35.710 --> 02:38.670
<b>Demon Lord Shin's Castle</b>

02:39.640 --> 02:40.440
<b>Do it.</b>

02:45.110 --> 02:47.110
<b>Quite the strong barrier.</b>

02:47.650 --> 02:50.110
<b>A hole this big is enough.</b>

02:50.570 --> 02:52.160
<b>We'll leave the rest to them.</b>

02:57.950 --> 02:58.830
<b>A counterattack?</b>

02:59.120 --> 03:00.710
<b>Even so, their response is too quick!</b>

03:01.830 --> 03:03.560
<b>Did our information leak out?</b>

03:04.770 --> 03:05.880
<b>Idiots.</b>

03:05.490 --> 03:10.960
<b>Power Level 65</b>

03:05.490 --> 03:10.960
<b>Southern Area 15 Demon Lord Shin</b>

03:05.880 --> 03:08.380
<b>Whatever time it may be,</b>

03:08.550 --> 03:10.670
<b>we never lower our guard to outsiders.</b>

03:11.510 --> 03:13.140
<b>Foolish humans!</b>

03:13.510 --> 03:16.850
<b>It is absurd for you to think
that you can ambush us.</b>

03:17.390 --> 03:19.270
<b>So that's this castle's Demon Lord.</b>

03:19.470 --> 03:20.240
<b>Seems like it.</b>

03:20.560 --> 03:22.850
<b>We're already well aware of your strength.</b>

03:23.400 --> 03:26.100
<b>Our country's soldiers are trained elites.</b>

03:27.400 --> 03:31.320
<b>There is not a single chance
that you will win.</b>

03:31.900 --> 03:32.950
<b>You have a point.</b>

03:33.280 --> 03:36.870
<b>Currently, we don't have
enough strength to defeat you.</b>

03:37.660 --> 03:38.450
<b>However...</b>

03:39.330 --> 03:42.710
<b>Victories in a war aren't just
decided through army strength.</b>

03:43.330 --> 03:44.330
<b>Right?</b>

03:44.620 --> 03:46.420
<b>Foolish humans...</b>

03:46.880 --> 03:47.790
<b>So be it, then.</b>

03:48.130 --> 03:51.590
<b>Whatever strategy you come up with,
we'll stomp it all out.</b>

03:53.630 --> 03:54.510
<b>Reporting!</b>

03:54.890 --> 03:57.800
<b>Monsters are advancing in from the south!</b>

03:58.260 --> 04:00.140
<b>Approximately 30,000 of them!</b>

04:03.980 --> 04:07.520
<b>We've confirmed multiple large monsters
that happen to be new world creatures!</b>

04:09.440 --> 04:10.480
<b>At a time like this...</b>

04:10.900 --> 04:12.240
<b>The monsters...</b>

04:12.940 --> 04:15.200
<b>...are attracted to
a human's or beast's life energy,</b>

04:15.490 --> 04:19.240
<b>as well as the barrier crystals
that you possess, I heard.</b>

04:20.120 --> 04:24.080
<b>If monsters appear
all at once in this area...</b>

04:24.960 --> 04:26.040
<b>Reporting!</b>

04:26.500 --> 04:28.590
<b>Monsters are advancing in from the north!</b>

04:29.170 --> 04:30.880
<b>Approximately 50,000 of them!</b>

04:33.220 --> 04:34.090
<b>Could it be...</b>

04:34.670 --> 04:36.540
<b>It's exactly what you think!</b>

04:36.760 --> 04:40.390
<b>We've already obtained the spell
needed to create monster nests!</b>

04:40.810 --> 04:42.390
<b>T-That's absurd...</b>

04:43.100 --> 04:46.100
<b>There is no way mere humans
can use a spell so high-caliber!</b>

04:47.150 --> 04:48.440
<b>Oh, but we can!</b>

04:48.440 --> 04:50.730
<b>We can use that spell!</b>

04:55.700 --> 04:56.660
<b>Now...</b>

04:57.110 --> 04:59.930
<b>Let us have Demon Lord Shin's Castle!</b>

05:07.120 --> 05:08.080
<b>Cless...</b>

05:08.710 --> 05:09.750
<b>Cless!</b>

05:10.170 --> 05:11.040
<b>Where are you?</b>

05:11.040 --> 05:12.340
<b>I'm also going to fight!</b>

05:12.710 --> 05:13.880
<b>Against Demon Lord Tooru.</b>

05:14.720 --> 05:17.430
<b>Just wait... I'll be right there.</b>

05:22.060 --> 05:24.270
<b>What is that light?</b>

05:26.410 --> 05:28.150
<b>M-Mikaros?</b>

05:28.520 --> 05:31.480
<b>Oh? I didn't think you'd make it out here.</b>

05:32.070 --> 05:35.110
<b>You've got amazing strength,
even while you haven't awakened.</b>

05:35.400 --> 05:36.820
<b>A-Awakened?</b>

05:37.360 --> 05:40.200
<b>No, more importantly, where's Cless?</b>

05:40.530 --> 05:44.430
<b>Cless likely would have arrived
at the Demon Lord Castle by now.</b>

05:44.660 --> 05:46.830
<b>He's already in battle, probably.</b>

05:47.790 --> 05:50.830
<b>W-Why are you taking this so lightly?
Let's hurry and back him up!</b>

05:51.250 --> 05:53.590
<b>Back him up? In that condition?</b>

05:53.920 --> 05:55.590
<b>You're going to die.</b>

05:55.760 --> 05:58.470
<b>I never intended to
come back alive from the start!</b>

05:58.880 --> 06:01.090
<b>I will be Cless's shield!</b>

06:02.970 --> 06:03.970
<b>I see.</b>

06:04.350 --> 06:07.640
<b>However, Zell, Demon Lord Tooru is strong.</b>

06:08.020 --> 06:11.440
<b>He's not some easy opponent
you can just defeat by willpower alone.</b>

06:11.900 --> 06:15.230
<b>In order to defeat him,
we need to lay out the groundwork.</b>

06:15.320 --> 06:16.190
<b>Groundwork?</b>

06:22.900 --> 06:24.160
<b>T-This is...</b>

06:24.490 --> 06:26.120
<b>This repulsive aura...</b>

06:26.660 --> 06:27.910
<b>Long ago,</b>

06:28.160 --> 06:33.460
<b>I once traveled various lands
in order to make myself stronger.</b>

06:34.090 --> 06:37.130
<b>This spell is a forbidden curse
I acquired during that time.</b>

06:38.670 --> 06:39.630
<b>Forbidden curse?</b>

06:40.050 --> 06:42.010
<b>What in the world are you trying to...</b>

06:44.680 --> 06:47.270
<b>Strengthening our fighting power.</b>

06:51.730 --> 06:52.690
<b>Monsters...</b>

06:56.230 --> 06:57.480
<b>Did you say something?</b>

06:57.860 --> 06:58.530
<b>Nothing.</b>

06:59.040 --> 07:01.050
<b>Still, a Demon Lord Castle
really is amazing.</b>

07:01.820 --> 07:06.080
<b>Even against this many monsters,
they're still not letting anything inside.</b>

07:06.790 --> 07:08.100
<b>I also don't like how calm
that Demon Lord is looking.</b>

07:09.500 --> 07:12.120
<b>Even so, we can see them start to crack.</b>

07:12.620 --> 07:13.790
<b>It's almost time!</b>

07:14.670 --> 07:16.800
<b>Let's go! We're after the barrier crystal!</b>

07:22.430 --> 07:23.570
<b>Enemies from behind us!</b>

07:25.760 --> 07:27.140
<b>Gather up at one spot!</b>

07:40.860 --> 07:42.490
<b>That disgusting mask...</b>

07:42.860 --> 07:44.740
<b>It's him! He came here!</b>

07:48.660 --> 07:49.740
<b>And go!</b>

07:51.250 --> 07:52.190
<b>Shields!</b>

07:55.000 --> 07:57.540
<b>Reinforcements! Reinforcements are here!</b>

07:58.040 --> 07:59.730
<b>You're too naive,</b>

08:00.090 --> 08:01.300
<b>humans.</b>

08:01.840 --> 08:03.300
<b>Brace yourselves.</b>

08:03.880 --> 08:06.990
<b>We'll put an end to you all
along with the monsters!</b>

08:07.970 --> 08:11.020
<b>Why are you acting
like you've already won?</b>

08:12.270 --> 08:14.270
<b>This is exactly what we wanted!</b>

08:15.810 --> 08:18.860
<b>Right now, things are probably
looking bad around that side.</b>

08:19.320 --> 08:21.670
<b>Coming here was a mistake,</b>

08:21.670 --> 08:23.450
<b>Heavenly King Azudra!</b>

08:24.690 --> 08:27.110
<b>Tooru's Castle</b>

08:28.620 --> 08:29.910
<b>Intruder! Intruder!</b>

08:30.080 --> 08:31.090
<b>Gather up the soldiers!</b>

08:32.100 --> 08:35.960
<b>If there are no Heavenly Kings here,
this is as much as they can do.</b>

08:37.420 --> 08:39.040
<b>Now, let's go.</b>

08:40.100 --> 08:42.420
<b>The barrier crystal is just ahead.</b>

08:44.050 --> 08:45.470
<b>R-Reporting!</b>

08:45.800 --> 08:47.940
<b>A horde of monsters coming
directly from the northwest!</b>

08:48.050 --> 08:50.160
<b>Approximately 10,000 of them!</b>

08:50.810 --> 08:52.030
<b>No way...</b>

08:52.140 --> 08:53.810
<b>This is bad! Hey, this is bad!</b>

08:59.730 --> 09:03.130
<b>Fist-of-the-Gentle-Breeze! 30-fold!</b>

09:07.450 --> 09:08.840
<b>Come on!</b>

09:10.910 --> 09:12.050
<b>You...</b>

09:12.050 --> 09:13.870
<b>Fools should stand back!</b>

09:14.120 --> 09:15.830
<b>I will be their opponent!</b>

09:16.960 --> 09:20.690
<b>Behold, the strength of my defense!</b>

09:22.050 --> 09:24.710
<b>If you keep defending,
you won't be able to defeat me.</b>

09:26.960 --> 09:28.940
<b>Defense Bomber!</b>

09:29.720 --> 09:31.350
<b>What is that?!</b>

09:34.180 --> 09:36.270
<b>You did quite the interesting thing.</b>

09:38.650 --> 09:39.350
<b>Doruushi!</b>

09:39.350 --> 09:40.830
<b>Stop it, bastard!</b>

09:48.740 --> 09:51.590
<b>I thought we'd have
a bit more trouble than this.</b>

09:51.870 --> 09:54.290
<b>What an unsatisfying fight.</b>

09:57.660 --> 09:59.930
<b>You managed to wound me...</b>

10:00.420 --> 10:01.880
<b>Not bad.</b>

10:02.960 --> 10:05.230
<b>I can't let you go any further.</b>

10:06.520 --> 10:08.520
<b>You think you can win by yourself?</b>

10:08.520 --> 10:11.220
<b>Who knows.
But you won't know until you try.</b>

10:12.570 --> 10:13.890
<b>You must know already.</b>

10:14.010 --> 10:16.060
<b>Someone at your skill level</b>

10:16.430 --> 10:17.980
<b>won't be able to win against me.</b>

10:22.860 --> 10:23.570
<b>So fast!</b>

10:32.370 --> 10:33.510
<b>Too bad.</b>

10:41.250 --> 10:42.580
<b>Yeah, too bad.</b>

10:50.630 --> 10:55.100
<b>I did let my guard down because
there had been no good fighters.</b>

10:55.510 --> 10:58.320
<b>Sure, why not.
I'll play with you for a bit.</b>

11:18.370 --> 11:19.300
<b>Wait...</b>

11:21.660 --> 11:23.470
<b>Wait a minute, you... That's...</b>

11:25.040 --> 11:26.290
<b>Were you surprised?</b>

11:26.500 --> 11:29.840
<b>My body can regenerate, you see.</b>

11:30.200 --> 11:32.300
<b>What I'm surprised about
was your sword's regeneration.</b>

11:32.860 --> 11:34.900
<b>Body regeneration is just common sense.</b>

11:35.510 --> 11:36.470
<b>Ow!</b>

11:36.850 --> 11:37.930
<b>Ow ow ow...</b>

11:37.930 --> 11:40.770
<b>Edil, you really have gotten stronger.</b>

11:41.680 --> 11:44.730
<b>However, you're still far below Hyura.</b>

11:45.980 --> 11:47.480
<b>Is Hyura here?</b>

11:51.460 --> 11:53.740
<b>Seems like you'd be at your limit soon.</b>

11:54.280 --> 11:56.830
<b>Your body appears immortal at a glance.</b>

11:56.830 --> 11:58.830
<b>But your regenerative powers</b>

11:59.120 --> 12:03.830
<b>can deplete your body
of its stored-up energy.</b>

12:04.170 --> 12:06.460
<b>If I keep slashing you
in a short period of time,</b>

12:06.750 --> 12:11.010
<b>your body will eventually run out of energy
and be unable to regenerate.</b>

12:11.210 --> 12:13.190
<b>Doesn't the same apply to you?</b>

12:13.190 --> 12:14.380
<b>Correct.</b>

12:14.590 --> 12:17.680
<b>However, I can very much
still keep fighting.</b>

12:18.010 --> 12:20.680
<b>I can also very much still keep fighting.</b>

12:20.970 --> 12:22.830
<b>What a hardworker.</b>

12:22.990 --> 12:25.670
<b>Are you possibly planning something?</b>

12:25.940 --> 12:29.170
<b>Buying time until reinforcements arrive?</b>

12:29.360 --> 12:31.750
<b>Or are you devising a way to defeat me?</b>

12:33.030 --> 12:36.010
<b>Sure, whatever. Feel free to do anything.</b>

12:36.280 --> 12:40.160
<b>I'm also going to fight
a bit more seriously for you.</b>

12:43.250 --> 12:44.460
<b>Dammit, wait a...</b>

12:45.210 --> 12:46.210
<b>Oh?</b>

12:46.750 --> 12:48.500
<b>You must not underestimate demons.</b>

12:49.250 --> 12:51.100
<b>Leave this place to me and go on ahead.</b>

12:52.760 --> 12:53.920
<b>Sure, then.</b>

12:54.340 --> 12:57.180
<b>Then, I'll leave this place to you.</b>

13:07.150 --> 13:09.660
<b>Oh, it really is
as magnificent as I thought.</b>

13:10.020 --> 13:14.650
<b>If I have this much power,
I can create gates with no problem at all.</b>

13:25.330 --> 13:26.210
<b>Tree roots?</b>

13:26.790 --> 13:28.670
<b>No, not only that...</b>

13:29.040 --> 13:30.440
<b>This is... a barrier?</b>

13:30.440 --> 13:31.230
<b>Could it be...</b>

13:33.960 --> 13:36.720
<b>Are you perhaps a hero, or a king?</b>

13:37.300 --> 13:39.640
<b>Or perhaps you're something else entirely?</b>

13:40.180 --> 13:41.050
<b>Why...</b>

13:41.470 --> 13:44.100
<b>I thought he was heading to Shin's Castle.</b>

13:44.390 --> 13:45.350
<b>He's...</b>

13:46.350 --> 13:51.150
<b>I thought troublesome opponents like you
should be dealt with as soon as possible.</b>

13:51.480 --> 13:53.080
<b>Thankfully, it went well.</b>

13:54.320 --> 13:56.440
<b>You've finally shown yourself,</b>

13:56.820 --> 13:58.280
<b>human mage.</b>

14:01.820 --> 14:02.680
<b>Strange.</b>

14:03.200 --> 14:04.620
<b>Why is he not moving?</b>

14:08.120 --> 14:08.840
<b>Could it be...</b>

14:12.090 --> 14:13.540
<b>You... what?</b>

14:15.130 --> 14:16.800
<b>Your ears got taken off!</b>

14:17.340 --> 14:18.170
<b>Oh, oops.</b>

14:20.360 --> 14:21.320
<b>Woof!</b>

14:21.510 --> 14:23.150
<b>You're that damn dog!</b>

14:23.150 --> 14:25.070
<b>Tch! A fake?!</b>

14:26.270 --> 14:27.890
<b>Heavenly King Azudra...</b>

14:28.690 --> 14:30.560
<b>To be honest, you surprised me.</b>

14:31.270 --> 14:34.730
<b>Not even we are able to
control teleportation spells.</b>

14:35.270 --> 14:36.030
<b>I never thought</b>

14:36.530 --> 14:39.900
<b>there'd ever be a human
who can use new world powers.</b>

14:40.450 --> 14:41.990
<b>And now, I'm convinced.</b>

14:43.660 --> 14:46.080
<b>You're the one who
killed the Demon Lord, right?</b>

14:49.040 --> 14:50.290
<b>Correct answer.</b>

14:50.500 --> 14:52.500
<b>As I would expect from a Heavenly King.</b>

14:52.750 --> 14:56.300
<b>The one who killed Demon Lord Tooru
and Demon Lord Urum was me.</b>

14:57.130 --> 15:01.030
<b>Even up until their dying moments,
they appealed for peace.</b>

15:02.220 --> 15:04.780
<b>It was truly amusing to watch.</b>

15:05.100 --> 15:06.140
<b>I see.</b>

15:06.760 --> 15:08.810
<b>I will never forgive you.</b>

15:15.960 --> 15:19.190
<b>How annoying... I have to do
something about these roots fi...</b>

15:21.820 --> 15:23.610
<b>Hey. Don't go too far.</b>

15:24.760 --> 15:25.870
<b>My teleportation spell...</b>

15:27.790 --> 15:29.140
<b>Tree Lance.</b>

15:29.140 --> 15:30.010
<b>Go!</b>

15:42.090 --> 15:44.090
<b>New world powers, huh?</b>

15:44.470 --> 15:47.510
<b>As I thought,
touching it makes me feel sick.</b>

15:48.070 --> 15:48.780
<b>I'll return it to you.</b>

15:54.560 --> 15:57.980
<b>That would be enough to
deal some damage, right?</b>

16:00.230 --> 16:02.000
<b>You don't spare me any mercy.</b>

16:02.400 --> 16:04.210
<b>If you kill me,</b>

16:04.210 --> 16:07.910
<b>I'm just going to go back to life,
just like the heroes.</b>

16:08.080 --> 16:08.950
<b>That's not possible.</b>

16:09.640 --> 16:13.390
<b>If that were possible, you would have
shown yourself much earlier.</b>

16:13.960 --> 16:17.790
<b>And once you realized this is a trap,
you would've immediately killed yourself.</b>

16:18.140 --> 16:19.440
<b>Correct answer.</b>

16:19.550 --> 16:20.510
<b>However...</b>

16:21.090 --> 16:22.090
<b>Relax.</b>

16:22.380 --> 16:23.760
<b>I won't kill you just yet.</b>

16:24.260 --> 16:26.090
<b>I'll leave you at the brink of death,</b>

16:26.430 --> 16:29.560
<b>and I'll lock you up somewhere
your powers are unusable.</b>

16:30.140 --> 16:32.930
<b>I have so many things I want to ask you.</b>

16:35.020 --> 16:36.370
<b>How terrifying.</b>

16:36.480 --> 16:38.560
<b>You're just like how you were back then.</b>

16:38.710 --> 16:40.610
<b>No, you're different.</b>

16:40.820 --> 16:42.340
<b>You're different, aren't you?</b>

16:42.610 --> 16:45.280
<b>Back then, you weren't like this.</b>

16:45.910 --> 16:49.010
<b>That's right... back then,
there were more humans,</b>

16:49.160 --> 16:52.120
<b>and we were much stronger in that era.</b>

16:52.370 --> 16:55.640
<b>The ten human countries and
the great empire where the dragon lies,</b>

16:55.830 --> 16:59.130
<b>we all fought wars,
over and over, countless times.</b>

17:01.340 --> 17:04.630
<b>The one boy who stood on the frontlines.</b>

17:04.840 --> 17:06.820
<b>With the demon sword in his hand,</b>

17:07.090 --> 17:10.950
<b>he easily cut down
heroes from all countries.</b>

17:11.350 --> 17:13.690
<b>It was as if he was a demon god...</b>

17:13.810 --> 17:14.600
<b>That's right.</b>

17:14.890 --> 17:17.040
<b>You weren't like this before.</b>

17:17.460 --> 17:18.790
<b>You were terrifying.</b>

17:19.020 --> 17:21.900
<b>Anyone would flee while trembling in fear.</b>

17:22.500 --> 17:24.570
<b>Heavenly King Azudra...</b>

17:25.030 --> 17:27.990
<b>To humans, you were fear itself.</b>

17:42.800 --> 17:44.800
<b>Who... are you?</b>

17:45.380 --> 17:46.550
<b>Mikaros.</b>

17:47.050 --> 17:48.930
<b>My name is Mikaros.</b>

17:50.510 --> 17:51.950
<b>You don't know me.</b>

17:52.390 --> 17:53.890
<b>There's no way you would.</b>

17:54.560 --> 17:55.620
<b>That's because....</b>

17:55.850 --> 17:58.580
<b>...I was just a normal human
you can find anywhere.</b>

17:58.730 --> 18:01.980
<b>Just one out of
a million soldiers, nothing more.</b>

18:02.980 --> 18:05.880
<b>However, I remember you.</b>

18:06.360 --> 18:09.010
<b>It was burned into my eyes.</b>

18:09.490 --> 18:10.880
<b>At that moment...</b>

18:10.880 --> 18:13.740
<b>...my body was taken over by fear.</b>

18:13.950 --> 18:18.250
<b>My body was trembling,
and I found it hard to even breathe.</b>

18:21.290 --> 18:23.610
<b>I played dead among
my comrades's dead bodies</b>

18:23.610 --> 18:25.210
<b>and hid between corpses.</b>

18:27.260 --> 18:28.630
<b>Help...</b>

18:29.720 --> 18:31.760
<b>Mika... ro...</b>

18:32.180 --> 18:33.680
<b>Help...</b>

18:34.890 --> 18:39.310
<b>I had not a single feeling
of honor or pride left.</b>

18:39.810 --> 18:41.540
<b>I just wanted to live on.</b>

18:41.810 --> 18:44.080
<b>I desperately kept
my trembling body still,</b>

18:44.360 --> 18:45.520
<b>held my breath,</b>

18:45.730 --> 18:50.910
<b>and kept praying for you
to disappear in what felt like forever.</b>

18:51.660 --> 18:54.580
<b>There were several of us there
who survived,</b>

18:55.030 --> 18:57.950
<b>but not long afterwards,
they succumbed to the demon lands' poison,</b>

18:58.450 --> 19:00.120
<b>and died.</b>

19:03.500 --> 19:04.440
<b>I see.</b>

19:04.840 --> 19:06.210
<b>And back then, you...</b>

19:06.750 --> 19:10.840
<b>That's right.
I adapted to the demon lands' poison.</b>

19:11.320 --> 19:13.680
<b>And then I crawled back
from the brink of death,</b>

19:13.680 --> 19:15.700
<b>and I awakened!</b>

19:16.530 --> 19:19.740
<b>Those who are awakened
is granted a special power.</b>

19:20.020 --> 19:23.560
<b>With that power,
I was able to survive until now.</b>

19:24.400 --> 19:27.820
<b>Just like yours,
I have a body that doesn't age.</b>

19:28.860 --> 19:29.820
<b>I see.</b>

19:30.320 --> 19:34.490
<b>So you're after us to
take revenge for back then?</b>

19:34.780 --> 19:35.660
<b>Revenge?</b>

19:36.490 --> 19:37.790
<b>Nonsense.</b>

19:38.240 --> 19:40.910
<b>I have no interest in such a small matter.</b>

19:41.600 --> 19:43.520
<b>The birth of a new world!</b>

19:43.830 --> 19:47.300
<b>That is my one everlasting goal!</b>

19:51.340 --> 19:52.820
<b>Do you understand?</b>

19:52.930 --> 19:54.550
<b>You understand what that means?</b>

19:55.140 --> 19:57.350
<b>You're going to end this world?!</b>

19:57.890 --> 20:00.120
<b>That is the will of the world.</b>

20:01.770 --> 20:03.850
<b>You all are the rebels.</b>

20:05.520 --> 20:07.960
<b>After that, I journeyed across lands,</b>

20:08.110 --> 20:12.290
<b>learned various spells,
and developed many of my own.</b>

20:12.820 --> 20:15.170
<b>1500 years later,</b>

20:15.280 --> 20:18.180
<b>I have become incredibly powerful.</b>

20:20.600 --> 20:24.220
<b>Of course,
I have already noticed this is a trap.</b>

20:24.670 --> 20:27.270
<b>The reason why I still
walked in here knowing that</b>

20:27.460 --> 20:29.630
<b>is because I want to free myself from you.</b>

20:29.960 --> 20:33.720
<b>I want to rid myself of
the trauma you gave me.</b>

20:34.430 --> 20:36.030
<b>Heavenly King Azudra...</b>

20:36.180 --> 20:39.970
<b>You're not the object of my fear anymore!</b>

20:49.610 --> 20:50.820
<b>Seems like an arrest...</b>

20:53.820 --> 20:55.570
<b>...is too light of a punishment.</b>

20:56.410 --> 20:59.280
<b>I'm changing my plans.</b>

21:04.050 --> 21:05.460
<b>I will kill you.</b>

21:05.750 --> 21:06.920
<b>Right here and now!</b>

21:06.920 --> 21:10.040
<b>What are you saying?!
The current you is...</b>

22:45.010 --> 22:50.010
<b>Next Episode</b>

22:45.010 --> 22:50.010
<b>Break the Curse</b>

22:45.950 --> 22:48.230
<b>Next episode, "Break the Curse".</b>
